Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:10.51,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5A162F&\blur4\fad(200,200)}哲学越来越复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:13.77,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HC45C1B&\blur4\fad(200,200)}它有多种解读方式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:17.21,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HF27BDF&&\blur4\fad(200,200)}只要离开这里就能勇往直前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:20.81,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFA838E&\blur4\fad(200,200)}向前迈进 我相信这样的理想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:24.21,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HDF7D3D&\blur4\fad(200,200)}必须改变心态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.43,0:01:27.74,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(200,200)}就是今天 说到做到
